WEBVTT

00:03.402 --> 00:04.712
<b>Checking landing area.</b>

00:04.712 --> 00:07.022
<b>Have everyone disembark! Hurry!</b>

00:07.932 --> 00:09.172
<b>We're saved.</b>

00:09.172 --> 00:11.032
<b>We'll be safe here.</b>

00:11.292 --> 00:14.332
<b>Everyone's off the ship. 
We're heading back to the battlefield.</b>

00:14.332 --> 00:15.492
<b>Leon's Dad.</b>

00:15.492 --> 00:17.032
<b>We'll go with you.</b>

00:17.412 --> 00:22.032
<b>You're hurt. Students 
should stay evacuated.</b>

00:22.032 --> 00:23.412
<b>B-But...</b>

00:23.412 --> 00:25.502
<b>It's all right, boys.</b>

00:25.792 --> 00:28.742
<b>You've already proven your courage.</b>

00:28.742 --> 00:30.382
<b>Ladies...</b>

00:30.382 --> 00:33.342
<b>Leon will be fine.</b>

00:33.342 --> 00:35.232
<b>Trust him.</b>

00:36.712 --> 00:37.902
<b>Trust him?</b>

00:38.622 --> 00:39.962
<b>Trust Leon?</b>

00:41.392 --> 00:43.312
<b>Wait, wait, wait.</b>

00:43.312 --> 00:44.962
<b>There's no way.</b>

00:54.652 --> 00:56.952
<b>A-At this rate, we'll be wiped out!</b>

01:08.202 --> 01:11.732
<b>Merging with that odd vehicle 
didn't do much to help you!</b>

01:17.302 --> 01:21.722
<b>Villains of the kingdom, 
I'll kill you all!</b>

01:21.942 --> 01:24.302
<b>He's lost his mind.</b>

01:24.302 --> 01:26.732
<b>The magical item has completely 
taken over his body.</b>

01:26.732 --> 01:27.972
<b>Damn it.</b>

01:27.972 --> 01:32.112
<b>Are you that desperate to 
keep fighting, old man?!</b>

01:44.662 --> 01:45.662
<b>Trapped in</b>

01:48.372 --> 01:49.912
<b>a Dating Sim</b>

01:57.902 --> 02:02.142
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim</b>

02:02.142 --> 02:06.742
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim 2</b>

03:09.722 --> 03:13.002
<b>There's a way to stop that monster.</b>

03:10.042 --> 03:14.002
I Don't Care About That!

03:14.272 --> 03:17.322
<b>Really, Marie? I mean, Lady Marie?</b>

03:17.322 --> 03:18.232
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:19.252 --> 03:24.012
<b><i>I only watched that cutscene from 
my brother's save file, but...</i></b>

03:24.442 --> 03:28.222
<b>That monster is being summoned 
by an item called a magic flute.</b>

03:28.222 --> 03:33.772
<b>She's right. I witnessed monsters 
being summoned on our school trip.</b>

03:34.132 --> 03:35.592
<b>A magic flute?</b>

03:36.182 --> 03:39.332
<b>That ship is the source 
of the flute's sound.</b>

03:41.192 --> 03:45.162
<b>Let's go. We have to end this suffering.</b>

03:45.492 --> 03:48.662
<b>Okay. Head to the owner 
of the magic flute!</b>

03:48.892 --> 03:52.932
<b>What? Who do you think you are? 
Don't tell us what to do.</b>

03:52.932 --> 03:55.292
<b><i>You haven't figured it out yet?!</i></b>

03:55.622 --> 03:57.732
<b>Kyle, just do it.</b>

03:57.732 --> 04:01.642
<b>Honestly, you never change, mistress.</b>

04:04.522 --> 04:06.892
<b>What's wrong? Is that all you've got?</b>

04:06.892 --> 04:08.802
<b>Shut up, fallen warrior!</b>

04:12.582 --> 04:13.642
<b>Watch out!</b>

04:13.642 --> 04:15.032
<b>Damn it!</b>

04:24.772 --> 04:26.802
<b>I can't, I can't, I can't!</b>

04:25.572 --> 04:28.402
<b>What an unladylike voice.</b>

04:28.402 --> 04:30.482
<b>It's all right, though.</b>

04:30.482 --> 04:31.662
<b>Eare?</b>

04:32.132 --> 04:37.172
<b>Is that what you're calling 
me? How congenial.</b>

04:37.542 --> 04:40.262
<b>In any case, there's 
nothing to worry about.</b>

04:40.262 --> 04:43.172
<b>That sourpuss will escort us.</b>

04:44.062 --> 04:45.672
<b>Energy fully charged.</b>

04:46.092 --> 04:48.432
<b>Firing boson particle cannon.</b>

04:59.282 --> 05:01.542
<b>Wh-What was that light?</b>

05:01.542 --> 05:03.442
<b>I've never seen such magic before.</b>

05:04.802 --> 05:09.452
<b>Yes, it's magic.
Incredibly powerful magic.</b>

05:09.802 --> 05:12.432
<b>N-No, that's...</b>

05:12.902 --> 05:15.082
<b>The demon lord's wrath!</b>

05:18.452 --> 05:21.892
<b>Now, before that monster regenerates!</b>

05:21.892 --> 05:24.092
<b>Yes, I know.</b>

05:28.402 --> 05:30.522
<b>We'll be their backup!</b>

05:30.522 --> 05:32.052
<b>Don't tell us what to do!</b>

05:38.602 --> 05:40.402
<b>There it is! The magic flute!</b>

05:40.772 --> 05:41.672
<b>That's...</b>

05:42.372 --> 05:43.622
<b>Hertrude!</b>

05:44.192 --> 05:45.912
<b>How did you get here?</b>

05:45.912 --> 05:48.202
<b>No, wait. Did you play the flute?</b>

05:49.712 --> 05:52.202
<b>I'll destroy them all.</b>

05:52.782 --> 05:56.762
<b>Please stop. At this rate, 
everyone will die.</b>

05:58.052 --> 05:58.952
<b>So?</b>

05:59.732 --> 06:04.592
<b>So the people of the 
principality will die, too!</b>

06:04.592 --> 06:06.212
<b>Let's put an end to this!</b>

06:06.592 --> 06:07.442
<b>No.</b>

06:08.692 --> 06:09.932
<b>Never.</b>

06:09.932 --> 06:10.862
<b>You...</b>

06:10.862 --> 06:13.512
<b>If you want to kill me, then kill me!</b>

06:13.802 --> 06:16.742
<b>That won't stop the guardian of the land!</b>

06:16.742 --> 06:18.772
<b>It'll keep reviving!</b>

06:21.152 --> 06:25.932
<b>I understand that you hate us, but 
what's the point in continuing to fight?</b>

06:25.932 --> 06:28.612
<b>Won't it just cause more pointless deaths?</b>

06:28.612 --> 06:30.082
<b>Oh, shut up.</b>

06:30.082 --> 06:34.622
<b>The principality can trace its 
roots back to the Holfort royals.</b>

06:36.212 --> 06:40.622
<b>The principality? I don't care 
what happens to it anymore.</b>

06:40.992 --> 06:41.762
<b>What?</b>

06:42.252 --> 06:43.262
<b>What did you say?</b>

06:44.102 --> 06:45.082
<b>I don't care</b>

06:45.692 --> 06:51.512
<b>what happens to the principality 
that exploited me and my sister.</b>

06:52.932 --> 06:58.082
<b>We didn't know they killed our 
parents, and we let them use us.</b>

07:00.062 --> 07:05.152
<b>Everything I loved has been taken 
from me, even my sister Rauda!</b>

07:05.582 --> 07:07.552
<b>I don't trust anyone anymore.</b>

07:07.552 --> 07:10.352
<b>They should all just go away!</b>

07:10.352 --> 07:14.662
<b>I want nothing more than to 
destroy this hopeless world!</b>

07:14.662 --> 07:18.282
<b>I want to avenge my sister and parents!</b>

07:18.662 --> 07:21.832
<b>Isn't that right? Why?</b>

07:22.262 --> 07:26.672
<b>Why couldn't we be happy? Why?!</b>

07:27.212 --> 07:30.422
<b>S-Still, this is wrong.</b>

07:30.832 --> 07:32.882
<b>What good is revenge?</b>

07:32.882 --> 07:36.062
<b>That's not what your sister wants!</b>

07:36.062 --> 07:37.182
<b>Shut up!</b>

07:37.432 --> 07:40.312
<b>Shut your mouth, dreamer!</b>

07:40.312 --> 07:42.032
<b>Ms. Marie?</b>

07:42.032 --> 07:45.732
<b>Wh-What are you saying? 
Whose side are you on?</b>

07:45.732 --> 07:48.922
<b>I don't know, and I don't care!</b>

07:48.922 --> 07:51.362
<b>That's just a bunch of 
idealistic nonsense!</b>

07:51.362 --> 07:56.372
<b>Revenge is wrong? Whatever! 
Who do you think you are?</b>

07:56.722 --> 07:59.802
<b>Her sister wouldn't want that?</b>

07:59.802 --> 08:03.582
<b>You've got some nerve 
speaking on her behalf!</b>

08:03.582 --> 08:04.872
<b>B-But...</b>

08:04.872 --> 08:08.452
<b>So she's supposed to accept her 
misery and not seek revenge?</b>

08:08.452 --> 08:10.632
<b>Does she not have the right to be happy?</b>

08:10.632 --> 08:13.332
<b>What about her feelings?!</b>

08:15.012 --> 08:17.002
<b>You have no problem lecturing her,</b>

08:17.002 --> 08:20.492
<b>but if you lost your loved ones, 
would you take it lying down?</b>

08:20.492 --> 08:23.322
<b>You wouldn't avenge them 
even if it's wrong?</b>

08:23.322 --> 08:25.022
<b>I-I...</b>

08:25.432 --> 08:28.032
<b>Have you ever experienced 
unbearable regret?</b>

08:28.032 --> 08:30.242
<b>Has anyone you loved ever died?</b>

08:30.242 --> 08:32.032
<b>You never get to see them again!</b>

08:33.082 --> 08:38.782
<b>It hurts when people you 
love die. It really hurts!</b>

08:39.102 --> 08:43.662
<b>W-Wait. Right now, stopping 
that monster is our priority.</b>

08:43.662 --> 08:45.122
<b>Shut up!</b>

08:45.342 --> 08:49.172
<b>If this is all it takes to destroy 
this world, then I say let it happen!</b>

08:49.542 --> 08:54.562
<b>I know it's wrong and that we 
shouldn't let it happen, but...</b>

08:54.562 --> 08:58.322
<b>but we still can't stop it!</b>

09:41.762 --> 09:48.812
<b>I never thought the Saint who only 
cares about money would defend me.</b>

09:50.082 --> 09:51.712
<b>I'm not defending you.</b>

09:51.712 --> 09:56.432
<b>I just can't stand those two and 
their main character syndrome.</b>

09:59.172 --> 10:03.082
<b>I never would have felt 
like this if not for you.</b>

10:03.972 --> 10:07.162
<b>Are you really okay with this, though?</b>

10:07.472 --> 10:08.842
<b>No.</b>

10:10.102 --> 10:11.632
<b>Not at all.</b>

10:13.322 --> 10:14.212
<b>But...</b>

10:19.492 --> 10:23.142
<b>Hurry. Get away from me.</b>

10:24.542 --> 10:25.672
<b>What's wrong?</b>

10:25.672 --> 10:30.292
<b>The cost of summoning guardians 
with this flute is the user's life.</b>

10:30.622 --> 10:32.572
<b>Now that I've broken the contract,</b>

10:33.472 --> 10:38.732
<b>I'll never be able to play it again, 
and the guardian will try to kill me.</b>

10:39.152 --> 10:40.372
<b>What?</b>

10:40.872 --> 10:42.032
<b>B-But...</b>

10:42.552 --> 10:46.452
<b>And the principality will surrender.</b>

10:54.462 --> 10:56.172
<b>Get away, everyone!</b>

11:00.512 --> 11:01.822
<b>Livia, are you all right?</b>

11:01.822 --> 11:02.832
<b>Vandel!</b>

11:03.542 --> 11:04.682
<b>What's going on?</b>

11:05.052 --> 11:07.062
<b>What are they doing here?</b>

11:09.172 --> 11:11.162
<b>Ms. Hertrude's here, too?</b>

11:17.162 --> 11:19.262
<b>Vandel, enough!</b>

11:19.262 --> 11:22.322
<b>Fanoss has declared the fighting over!</b>

11:23.022 --> 11:26.832
<b>Princess, do not worry.</b>

11:26.832 --> 11:29.462
<b>I'll kill that villain this instant.</b>

11:31.872 --> 11:35.832
<b>I shall obliterate the kingdom's forces.</b>

11:35.832 --> 11:39.592
<b>No! It's over, Vandel!</b>

11:41.812 --> 11:43.522
<b>Princess...</b>

11:53.632 --> 11:57.782
<b>Father, Mother...</b>

11:54.382 --> 11:58.612
<b>Are you sure this was the right choice?</b>

11:59.042 --> 12:03.842
<b>Both the people and nobility 
wish to fight the kingdom,</b>

12:03.842 --> 12:08.512
<b>which is why the king and 
queen had to go away.</b>

12:09.152 --> 12:11.692
<b>There's no point in crying over it now.</b>

12:11.692 --> 12:15.092
<b>You'll get to avenge your family.</b>

12:15.492 --> 12:19.492
<b>If you're a knight of the principality, 
forget your meaningless regrets.</b>

12:29.392 --> 12:30.342
<b>Princess.</b>

12:35.202 --> 12:36.292
<b>Vandel...</b>

12:38.022 --> 12:46.632
<b>Do not worry. I shall fight for you and 
your sister in your parents' place.</b>

12:48.472 --> 12:50.662
<b>Vandel...</b>

12:52.882 --> 12:54.812
<b>I swear on this sword...</b>

12:58.812 --> 13:00.672
<b>This cannot end.</b>

13:00.942 --> 13:04.172
<b>This cannot be the end!</b>

13:04.462 --> 13:05.452
<b>Vandel...</b>

13:06.682 --> 13:10.232
<b>I will keep fighting after my death.</b>

13:10.232 --> 13:13.632
<b>That is all I can do to atone.</b>

13:13.632 --> 13:15.732
<b>That is my...</b>

13:18.192 --> 13:21.692
<b>code of chivalry!</b>

13:29.132 --> 13:32.452
<b>You bastard!</b>

13:52.322 --> 13:54.242
<b>Damn it!</b>

13:58.792 --> 13:59.952
<b>Luxion!</b>

14:00.922 --> 14:03.002
<b>Damn you!</b>

14:05.112 --> 14:07.832
<b>Sorry, old man.</b>

14:10.862 --> 14:12.092
<b>Impact.</b>

14:26.122 --> 14:27.212
<b>Vandel!</b>

14:42.572 --> 14:47.232
<b>Vandel! Vandel! Vandel!</b>

14:47.232 --> 14:48.522
<b>Vandel!</b>

14:49.472 --> 14:52.052
<b>P-Princess...</b>

14:52.722 --> 14:56.742
<b>This is the end for me.</b>

14:57.122 --> 15:00.372
<b>Please don't leave me.</b>

15:01.572 --> 15:04.032
<b>Princess...</b>

15:04.032 --> 15:05.752
<b>Hey, you!</b>

15:06.022 --> 15:07.752
<b>Don't die yet!</b>

15:08.032 --> 15:11.552
<b>What are you saying? 
He's the Black Knight!</b>

15:11.782 --> 15:17.512
<b>I know that! How many times do 
you think he's beaten me? Still...</b>

15:20.522 --> 15:23.522
<b>Are you going to leave her all alone?</b>

15:29.132 --> 15:34.802
<b><i>There are those in the kingdom 
who care for the princess.</i></b>

15:35.272 --> 15:37.172
<b><i>Now I can finally...</i></b>

15:49.672 --> 15:51.482
<b><i>I lost.</i></b>

15:52.972 --> 15:56.072
<b>Princess, please...</b>

15:57.722 --> 15:58.702
<b>Vandel...</b>

16:01.932 --> 16:03.842
<b>Be happy.</b>

16:07.432 --> 16:08.502
<b>Vandel!</b>

16:31.672 --> 16:34.112
<b>Don't waste any time.</b>

16:34.112 --> 16:37.312
<b>If you don't get out of here 
quickly, you'll be killed, too.</b>

16:38.242 --> 16:39.602
<b>But...</b>

16:40.932 --> 16:42.972
<b>Come on, you two.</b>

16:42.972 --> 16:44.792
<b>Hurry, please.</b>

16:51.092 --> 16:52.452
<b>End this.</b>

17:08.242 --> 17:11.752
<b>Leon Fou Bartfort...</b>

17:12.022 --> 17:14.692
<b>Now, what should I do?</b>

17:14.692 --> 17:19.012
<b>Not much can be done against an 
endlessly regenerating enemy.</b>

17:19.262 --> 17:21.952
<b>Olivia is severely weakened.</b>

17:21.952 --> 17:23.012
<b>Luxion.</b>

17:23.882 --> 17:24.712
<b>What is it?</b>

17:26.542 --> 17:27.662
<b>Understood.</b>

17:28.522 --> 17:32.522
<b>The main ship is out of range, 
so I'll gather energy in the Arroganz.</b>

17:32.982 --> 17:35.032
<b>Out of range? For what?</b>

17:39.132 --> 17:40.922
<b>Olivia's power.</b>

17:42.182 --> 17:43.542
<b>Mr. Leon...</b>

17:44.792 --> 17:46.762
<b>Livia... Angie...</b>

17:47.872 --> 17:50.602
<b>I'll add Olivia's wavelength 
to your attack.</b>

17:56.272 --> 17:59.112
<b>It's time to go big or go home.</b>

18:07.942 --> 18:09.392
<b>Don't let them get close!</b>

18:09.392 --> 18:11.122
<b>Don't tell us what to do!</b>

18:26.982 --> 18:28.052
<b>Fabulous.</b>

19:06.612 --> 19:09.372
<b>He saved me?</b>

19:10.862 --> 19:12.152
<b>He defeated it!</b>

19:12.152 --> 19:13.322
<b>Yes!</b>

19:15.282 --> 19:18.152
<b>We finally defeated the final boss.</b>

19:18.152 --> 19:21.092
<b>Arroganz has reached its limit, though.</b>

19:26.272 --> 19:27.312
<b>Leon!</b>

19:30.972 --> 19:32.182
<b>Oh, my.</b>

19:47.902 --> 19:51.582
<b>Hey, did I do the right thing?</b>

19:53.372 --> 19:58.512
<b>I said I wanted to live a 
peaceful life as an NPC,</b>

19:59.692 --> 20:01.902
<b>but tons of people ended up dying.</b>

20:02.592 --> 20:04.292
<b>I killed a ton of people, too.</b>

20:05.672 --> 20:10.932
<b>If I were the protagonist of a story, 
I could've done a better job.</b>

20:12.932 --> 20:15.252
<b>You're overestimating your own importance.</b>

20:15.252 --> 20:20.942
<b>The war would've happened either way, 
and nobody expected much from you.</b>

20:24.032 --> 20:25.382
<b>You're a real dick.</b>

20:28.192 --> 20:31.102
<b>So I am just an NPC.</b>

20:32.302 --> 20:35.222
<b>Anyway, I'm surprised we won.</b>

20:35.962 --> 20:40.802
<b>Isn't that because this is the world 
of your so-called "otome game"?</b>

20:41.742 --> 20:44.112
<b>Huh? What do you mean?</b>

20:45.002 --> 20:48.592
<b>You're always complaining about 
it while hurling obscenities.</b>

20:49.272 --> 20:52.552
<b>How "love will save the world."</b>

21:09.092 --> 21:10.262
<b>Leon!</b>

21:10.262 --> 21:11.862
<b>Mr. Leon!</b>

21:12.562 --> 21:14.832
<b>Angie, Livia.</b>

21:16.942 --> 21:21.382
<b>You may be an NPC, but their love is real.</b>

21:21.992 --> 21:25.162
<b>The truth is that love ended the fighting.</b>

21:26.322 --> 21:29.842
<b>Isn't it about time you 
made your decision?</b>

21:30.832 --> 21:33.512
<b>You love them, don't you?</b>

21:34.802 --> 21:36.772
<b>You don't get it.</b>

21:37.942 --> 21:42.212
<b>I want to take good care of 
them <i>because</i> I love them.</b>

21:44.622 --> 21:49.252
<b><i>I hadn't thought about what 
I'd say, but for now...</i></b>

21:52.052 --> 21:53.322
<b>I'm back.</b>

23:26.292 --> 23:29.572
<b>The fighting's over, peace has been 
restored, and my brother's engaged?</b>

23:29.572 --> 23:30.302
<b>Master.</b>

23:30.302 --> 23:32.632
<b>Leon's screams echo across 
an inescapable future!</b>

23:32.862 --> 23:33.802
<b>Master?</b>

23:33.802 --> 23:36.322
<b>The final episode, 
"This World Is Tough for Mobs."</b>

23:36.642 --> 23:39.972
<b>The final boss of life is romantic events!</b>
